'''Looker''' (Japanese: '''ハンサム''' ''Handsome'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Your opponent reveals all of the {{TCGP|Supporter card}}s in their deck.
}}

